flowchart TB
    accTitle: Two rendering strategies in one Django app
    accDescr: Django views split two ways. CRUD pages (entries, cockpit, settings, consolidated) use HtmxLoginRequiredMixin to return either a full page or an HTML fragment, swapped straight into the DOM by htmx. The dashboard route returns a shell of empty divs carrying data-react-component and data-api-url, which mount.tsx hydrates into React cards that fetch JSON from the DRF endpoints under /api/dashboard/.

    browser([🌐 Browser])

    subgraph server ["🐍 One Django app"]
        direction TB
        crud[⚙️ HtmxLoginRequiredMixin views<br/>entries · cockpit · settings · consolidated]
        shell[⚙️ DashboardView<br/>renders an empty grid]
        api[[🔌 DRF APIView · /api/dashboard/<br/>9 read-only JSON endpoints]]
    end

    crud -->|"HTML fragment (hx-target swap)"| htmx[🔁 htmx<br/>27 hx-get · 28 hx-post · 54 hx-target]
    shell -->|"divs with data-react-component"| mount[⚛️ mount.tsx<br/>querySelectorAll → createRoot]
    mount -->|"one root per card"| cards[📊 9 dashboard cards + 1 chat widget<br/>useApiData + Recharts]
    cards -->|"fetch JSON"| api
    api -->|"Response(...)"| cards

    htmx --> browser
    cards --> browser

